@startuml usecase
!pragma layout smetana
title COLORS Web Application - Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "User" as user

rectangle "COLORS Web Application" {
  usecase "Log In" as UC1
  usecase "Add Color" as UC2
  usecase "Search Colors" as UC3
  usecase "Log Out" as UC4
}

user -- UC1
user -- UC2
user -- UC3
user -- UC4

note right of UC1
  index.html: login name + password.
  Password is MD5-hashed in the browser
  and checked against the Users table.
  On success a 20-minute cookie stores
  firstName, lastName and userId.
end note

note right of UC2
  Precondition: logged in (color.html
  runs readCookie() on load and redirects
  to index.html if no userId is found).
  Inserts the color for the current user.
end note

note right of UC3
  Precondition: logged in.
  Substring match on the current user's
  colors only; an empty search term
  returns all of that user's colors.
end note

note right of UC4
  Expires the session cookie and
  returns to index.html.
end note

note bottom of user
  Accounts already exist in the Users
  table (inserted via SQL). The app has
  no registration use case.
end note
@enduml
